<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Now, the time when those many mysteries will be solved has drawn near as well, has it not? The Jusatsu Arc [Killing by Curse], too, is nearing its final act.<PG>
However, in this world, many mysteries, and things such as hatred, unease and distrust, are swirling.<PG>
Even if the Jusatsu Arc [Killing by Curse] is completed, that does not necessarily mean all of those mysteries will be solved.<PG>
Rather, it is even possible that the Jusatsu Arc [Killing by Curse] is nothing but the introduction to them―in other words, only the tip of the iceberg.<PG>
To begin with, why was this arc named the 'Jusatsu Arc [Killing by Curse]'? Does it speak of Haruka Niimura's curse, or else...<PG>
I wonder if I have talked a little too much. It is about time I guided you to the last branch of the Jusatsu Arc [Killing by Curse].<PG>
As we go far back in time, a story quite different from those so far will likely unfold.<PG>
Now then, please keep me company a little longer.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
